Error [jet.UseWhileWriteActive]: `t` is already lent to this call, so `pair` can't take it here too
  --> tests/ui/take_while_lent.jet:5:19
    |
  5 |     print(pair(t, t))
    |                   ^
 Why: An earlier argument lets `pair` read `t` for the whole call, so this argument can't hand the same value over
 Fix: Pass a copy to one of the two parameters with `t.copy()`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0204

Error [jet.UseWhileWriteActive]: `u` is already lent to this call, so `pair` can't take it here too
  --> tests/ui/take_while_lent.jet:7:19
    |
  7 |     print(pair(u, u))
    |                   ^
 Why: An earlier argument lets `pair` read `u` for the whole call, so this argument can't hand the same value over
 Fix: Pass a copy to one of the two parameters with `u.copy()`
